# Emacs 20.7 PS2 Linux/musl target feature profile.
# Derived from compile/link probes using the matching R5900 GCC 15.2.0,
# musl and ncurses 6.5 development toolchain; editor execution checked in
# R5900 emulation. These are NOT all native configure-probe results.
# Compiler identity, compiler execution and tool paths are detected afresh.
# Runtime localtime caching uses configure's conservative cross-build answer.
# Use PAKMAN_EMACS_CONFIG_CACHE=none to run all feature probes on the console.
